// Module c-parkinsonism: parkinsonism and hyperkinetic disorders. Describing the movement
// before naming a disease, Parkinson disease and its mimics (atypical and drug-induced
// parkinsonism), essential tremor, chorea, dystonia, and the dopamine-related emergencies.
// Doses are deliberately left out.

